cmd-wofroof-desc = Adds or removes roofs so dragons can't descend into an area.
cmd-wofroof-help = Usage: wofroof room [on|off]  (the enclosed room you're standing in)
    or: wofroof radius <0-50> [on|off]  (a square around you)
    or: wofroof grid [on|off]  (every floor tile on this grid)
cmd-wofroof-no-entity = You need to be in the game to use this.
cmd-wofroof-no-grid = You need to be standing on a grid.
cmd-wofroof-room-too-big = That room is bigger than {$max} tiles. Is it really enclosed? Use radius instead.
cmd-wofroof-bad-radius = Radius must be a whole number from 0 to 50.
cmd-wofroof-done-on = Roofed {$count} tiles.
cmd-wofroof-done-off = Removed roofs from {$count} tiles.
